# are left to 404. Bulk-redirecting unrelated posts to the homepage is treated
# by Google as a soft 404 — it passes no value and dilutes the homepage's topic
# signal. If Search Console later shows one of them holding real referring
# domains, add a single targeted rule for that URL above.
#
